{"server":"tw","storyId":"1stact_level_a001_02_beg","groupId":"1stact","stageId":"a001_02","title":"察言觀色","storyCode":"GT-2","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_02_beg.txt","sourceHash":"e981b688f4234fa6da524d0a3ea206b604153745e28fe2fd2f838e019fae813f","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"攔住她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗暴的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"攔什麼啊！你沒看到他們全部被幹掉了嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"你上啊，你平常不是很厲害嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗暴的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"我，我不行！這傢伙可是那個災星啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"（阿戈爾語）攔住我的都會死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"（阿戈爾語）向我揮出武器的都將粉身碎骨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"（阿戈爾語）想死的，向前踏出一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“上尉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"你究竟在說些什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"唉？上尉？上尉怎麼消失了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗暴的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"上尉掉進河裡了......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"這、這傢伙一擊就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，忘了他們聽不懂......算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"說，她在哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"她？你指誰？別問我，我什麼不知道啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃啊！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗暴的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"給、給我記住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗暴的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！你們別急著撤退！先把上尉撈起來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_towerinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"那、那個人是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"你認識她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"她可能是我的同事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，接到這項委託的應該是我啊？我可是好不容易才從隕星姐手裡搶到這項任務的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"唔唔唔......也許她是為別的任務來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，賞金獵人好像被擊退了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"事不宜遲，我們趁現在溜出村子吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"既然還有其他幹員在這個村子裡，說不定事情會好辦一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"可蘿爾，樓梯很黑，你要扶緊我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"那個，你要和她聯絡一下嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，如果可能的話，我想——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"噗啊————————！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"哇——————！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我的鼻子！這扇門怎麼自己彈開——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？這裡怎麼會蹲著人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"格拉尼！發生了什——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗暴的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"你們全都給我閉嘴！噓！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"......噓？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你們這些幹農活的肯定什麼都不懂。沒看到那個災星嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"無論是哪個賞金獵人，都不會想和她碰面的！敢在她面前昂首挺胸的，多半是沒見過她毀掉整座城市的樣子吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼誇張嗎！那不是靠她一個人就可以把————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗暴的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"聲音輕點，別被她發現！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，可是我還要找她——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗暴的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"說了小聲點！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"感覺比羅德島裡流傳的版本更離譜......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"那、那個怪物走了嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗暴的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好像走了......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"總算走了，啊喲，嚇死我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"是，是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗暴的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"原以為這點活我們一隊就能搞定，怎麼會碰上這種麻煩事。那種傢伙都來了的話，得做好準備才能——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗暴的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"——等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗暴的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"哈！拿槍的小子！居然在這裡碰見你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗暴的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"還有村長！你真是送上門來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"格拉尼，你難道是故意......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"不，只是他們態度那麼好，我也沒回過神來啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"廢話少說，把村長交給我們！不然我保證會用手裡這把刀讓你吃足苦頭！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"就用那把斷刀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"......這，這小子什麼時候出的槍？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗暴的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"用暗號召集附近還在的人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗暴的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，去把之前用來毀掉農田的蟲子都趕出來，讓她們嘗嘗厲害！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_220_grani","aliases":["格拉尼"]},{"speakerId":"char_263_skadi","aliases":["？？？"]}]}
